// f32 `ln`, `log2`, `log10` and `ln_1p`, ported from LLVM libc into `core::libm`, against
// LLVM libc itself. For each input, given by its bits, this prints the bits of the four
// results (a NaN as 2143289344). The expected line is what LLVM libc at f475f085bf7b prints,
// built with FMA. The inputs are every input LLVM libc special-cases and every boundary
// between the code's branches, each with its two neighbours; an input reaching each entry of
// the 128-entry tables, near 1 and near 4; zeros, infinities, quiet and signaling NaNs,
// subnormals, powers of ten and a few ordinary values. The port was also checked against
// LLVM libc on all 2^32 inputs.
//
// EXPECT: 4286578688 4286578688 4286578688 0 3268316880 3272933376 3258149364 1 3266852082 3271876748 3256877057 71362 3266227280 3271294976 3256334360 8388607 3266227280 3271294976 3256334360 8388608 3266227280 3271294976 3256334360 8388609 3263593114 3267494679 3253312803 251588217 3263593114 3267494679 3253312803 251588218 3263593114 3267494679 3253312802 251588219 3258463473 3263488139 3248488448 507307272 3248904950 3253731328 3239083665 813694976 3244452086 3248706047 3234113601 893386750 3244452086 3248706047 3234113600 893386751 3244452086 3248706047 3234113600 893386751 3241846470 3246826492 3231850391 923795442 3241846470 3246826492 3231850391 923795443 3241846470 3246826492 3231850391 923795443 3235761822 3240099840 3225462977 981458949 3229947282 3233808384 3219599592 1014891845 3229947282 3233808384 3219599592 1014891846 3229947282 3233808384 3219599591 1014891847 3207852941 3212955319 3197914564 1053683425 3207852940 3212955318 3197914563 1053683425 3207852939 3212955317 3197914562 1053683426 3207688728 3212836864 3197771931 1053792543 3197324049 3201597388 3187662817 1057964795 3188283255 3192267874 3178141246 1059117674 3188283250 3192267868 3178141239 1059117675 3188283246 3192267861 3178141231 1059117675 3140669541 3145792688 3130740959 1060182207 3140669284 3145792503 3130740736 1060182208 3140669027 3145792318 3130740513 1060182208 3011510272 3015223868 3000916953 1060205079 0 0 0 1060205080 872415231 876128826 861821912 1060205081 974230950 978454717 964487171 1060209739 996231873 1000506250 985903015 1060233942 996232383 1000506618 985903458 1060233943 996232893 1000506986 985903902 1060233944 1007192055 1011153158 997010888 1060275130 1015250278 1019065122 1004825559 1060340266 1019362011 1024203638 1009300665 1060405150 1023426335 1027147083 1012844927 1060469785 1025451185 1030068325 1015692011 1060534171 1027460877 1032383241 1017437606 1060598311 1029455634 1033822154 1019170231 1060662207 1031435678 1035250453 1020890074 1060725861 10326